---
description: Best practices for React 19 applications
globs: **/*.{ts,tsx}
---
- Use the new `useActionState` hook for form state management instead of the deprecated `useFormState`.
- Take advantage of the enhanced `useFormStatus` hook with new properties like `data`, `method`, and `action`.
- Implement URL state management using 'nuqs' for better SEO and shareability.
- Minimize client-side state to reduce bundle size and improve performance.
- Utilize the new async versions of runtime APIs for server-side operations.